{
  "$comment": [
    "A snapshot of supabase_migrations.schema_migrations in PRODUCTION, taken during",
    "the migration-history reconciliation. It exists so that drift between the",
    "production ledger and this repository is a failing test rather than a",
    "discovery. tests/matrix/migrationHistory.test.mjs is what reads it.",
    "Regenerate only alongside a fresh, deliberate reconciliation.",
    "Updated the same day, after four rows were added to the production ledger by a",
    "concurrent repair that took the other route through this drift: it recorded the",
    "repo's own versions (20260919120000/160000/170000/180000) as applied rather than",
    "renaming the files down to the versions production had. The rename won, so those",
    "four rows now describe nothing in this repository. They are inert -- every one of",
    "them duplicates a change already applied and already reconciled -- but production",
    "holds 332 rows and a snapshot that said 328 would be a file claiming something",
    "about production that is not true. Hence 72 duplicates became 76."
  ],
